neering validation of the proposed ACs.\n9. **No scope traps detected** — NFRs (FIPS, container security, disconnected install) map to\n   acceptance criteria on the Konflux/packaging epics and do not imply nonexistent\n   infrastructure; out-of-scope items are consistent with the NFRs.\n\n## Tiered Delivery\n\nNot applicable. The external dependencies (upstream kagenti-operator and kagenti-extensions)\nalready exist and are functional per the dependency table; no dependency with uncertain timing\ngates a user-facing deliverable. The only timing risk (Konflux capacity) is an internal lead-time\nitem mitigated by starting the onboarding epics as DAG roots.\n\n## Conditional Decomposition Branches\n\n**E002 — AuthBridge variant set for TP** (bounded, 2 outcomes):\n\n- Outcome A (proxy only for TP): main plan stands as-is; the AuthBridge proxy Konflux epic\n  (E008) is the complete variant scope. No branch epic.\n- Outcome B (envoy and/or lite also needed for 3.5): `RHAISTRAT-8006-BRANCH-B-E015` adds the\n  additional Konflux components (and corresponding CSV entries).\n\n**E006 — OTEL trace sink requirement** (bounded, 2 outcomes):\n\n- Outcome A (not required for TP / deferred): no additional work; main plan stands.\n- Outcome B (confirmed TP requirement per parent RFE MUST):\n  `RHAISTRAT-8006-BRANCH-B-E016` adds the OTEL trace sink / telemetry auto-configuration wiring,\n  including its documentation coverage.\n\nBranch epics are attached to their gating Investigations as plan documents; they are excluded\nfrom the main-plan critical path.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":48261,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-81e9b625983a557d","agent_id":"a91ca77782a9ba1e7","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"4eb507d0-3431-4165-bd10-4eb067ddc605","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:17:23.217Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Deco