ture (architecture context,\n  odh-dashboard.md): extend it if it covers the needed surface, otherwise build the new plugin\n  and document why.\n- Full agent management UI is out of scope (read-only visibility only).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Given the dashboard deployed with the feature flag active, when a user navigates to the agent\n  views, the dashboard displays AgentRuntime CRs from the user's accessible namespaces,\n  measured by the view rendering data retrieved via the BFF API proxy.\n- When the kagenti component is `Removed` in the DSC, all agent-related UI elements are hidden.\n- The chosen port does not collide with existing BFF sidecar assignments.\n- UX design for the chosen integration depth (tab vs standalone section) is finalized and\n  implemented.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- P1: Dashboard integration infrastructure: BFF plugin registration and feature flag for agent\n  views.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":65881,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-81e9b625983a557d","agent_id":"a91ca77782a9ba1e7","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"3ef50337-c1cf-4586-9dc6-d16a9ca5c487","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:19:12.558Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8006"}
