anch epic activated) or\n47\t  deferred (with tracking location for the deferred work).\n48\t- If required, the minimal TP scope of the trace sink integration is enumerated so the branch\n49\t  epic can be scheduled.\n50\t\n51\t## HLR Traceability\n52\t\n53\t- No current HLR maps to this question (that is the point: the parent RFE MUST is not yet\n54\t  reflected). The answer determines whether an additional requirement/epic enters this\n55\t  strategy's scope.\n56\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a7235745e7d45a0a","agent_id":"ac2507bfc800dc5e2","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"c9c0afee-1344-4315-a168-add8b9eb4d8c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:23:42.570Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-84131f367dbd1799","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
