{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8010f2fcdb677723","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E013\n3\ttitle: QE test plan and E2E validation for kagenti component lifecycle\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: QE\n6\tteam: QE\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E010\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E011\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 1\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 0\n18\t  external_dependency: 0\n19\t  human_process_gates: 0\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 0\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 4\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# QE test plan and E2E validation for kagenti component lifecycle\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tCreate the QE test plan and E2E test suite validating the kagenti component lifecycle in\n36\tRHOAI: DSC enablement (Managed), disablement and cleanup (Removed, including resources in\n37\tmultiple namespaces), AuthBridge webhook ordering alongside other mutating webhooks, and\n38\tdisconnected-installation validation.\n39\t\n40\t## Description of upstream dependencies\n41\t\n42\tThe E2E suite builds against the rhods-operator component controller behavior and the CSV\n43\t`RELATED_IMAGE_*` packaging for disconnected validation; the Konflux-built images it deploys\n44\tare supplied as configuration references at execution time.\n45\t\n46\t## Scope\n47\t\n48\t- QE test plan for the kagenti-operator component covering component lifecycle, TP opt-in\n49\t  default, and disconnected installation.\n50\t- E2E tests for the Managed/Removed lifecycle per the decided cleanup contract, including\n51\t  resources in multiple namespaces and orphaned-CR handling.\n52\t- E2E coverage for AuthBridge sidecar injection webhook ordering combined with other platform\n53\t  mutating webhooks (e.g., HardwareProfile, connection injection), exercising the\n54\t  `reinvocationPolicy: IfNeeded` behavior and explicit `webhookOrder` annotations if conflicts\n55\t  arise.\n56\t- Disconnected-install validation exercising image mirroring via the CSV `RELATED_IMAGE_*`\n57\t  entries.\n58\t\n59\t## Acceptance Criteria\n60\t\n61\t- Test plan reviewed and approved by QE.\n62\t- E2E suite passes against a cluster with the component `Managed`: deployment becomes Ready,\n63\t  AgentRuntime reconciliation works end to end.\n64\t- E2E suite passes the Managed→Removed transition with all operator-managed resources cleaned\n65\t  up per the decided cleanup contract (verified across multiple namespaces).\n66\t- Disconnected-install validation passes with images resolved from a mirrored registry.\n67\t- Webhook-ordering scenarios pass (no pod creation failures or unexpected sidecar behavior\n68\t  when combined with other mutating webhooks).\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- Verifies the P0 HLRs for DSC enablement/disablement and Removed cleanup, and the P1 HLR for\n73\t  OLM/CSV disconnected-install packaging (acceptance validation workstream named in the\n74\t  strategy's impacted-teams table).\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a7235745e7d45a0a","agent_id":"ac2507bfc800dc5e2","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"e38bd4d8-71c7-4578-b656-1a277ac09311","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:23:55.030Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8010f2fcdb677723","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
