{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc568dbd228c2d97","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E011\n3\ttitle: OLM/CSV packaging with RELATED_IMAGE entries for disconnected install\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: AI Core Platform\n6\tteam: Platform / ODH Operator\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E010\n11\tai_signals:\n12\t  change_specificity: 1\n13\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n14\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n15\t  existing_foundation: 1\n16\t  open_questions: 1\n17\t  external_dependency: 0\n18\t  human_process_gates: 0\n19\t  repo_access: 1\n20\t  architecture_claims: 1\n21\timplementation_type: null\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 6\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# OLM/CSV packaging with RELATED_IMAGE entries for disconnected install\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tAdd the kagenti-operator and AuthBridge images to the rhods-operator\n35\tClusterServiceVersion with SHA256-pinned `RELATED_IMAGE_*` environment variables, and declare\n36\tthe new `KagentiOperator` component CRD and its RBAC in the CSV, enabling OLM relatedImages for\n37\tdisconnected/air-gapped installation with image mirroring.\n38\t\n39\t## Description of upstream dependencies\n40\t\n41\tThis epic builds on the KagentiOperator component CRD and RBAC produced by the rhods-operator\n42\tcomponent controller work (it declares them in the CSV). The image digests it pins are\n43\tconfiguration references supplied at execution time by the Konflux builds — availability is an\n44\tacceptance criterion, not a scheduling dependency, so this work proceeds in parallel with the\n45\tKonflux onboarding.\n46\t\n47\t## Scope\n48\t\n49\t- Add CSV `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries: `RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` (operator image) and\n50\t  `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` (AuthBridge proxy sidecar image), SHA256-pinned, with\n51\t  placeholders for additional AuthBridge variants if the variant-set decision adds them.\n52\t- Declare the `KagentiOperator` CRD and the RBAC the component controller needs to manage\n53\t  kagenti-operator resources.\n54\t- Validate the CSV renders correctly with the existing packaging tooling.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- Given a disconnected RHOAI installation using image mirroring, when the kagenti component is\n59\t  `Managed`, the operator and AuthBridge images resolve from the mirrored registry via the\n60\t  `RELATED_IMAGE_*` environment variables, measured by the kagenti-operator Deployment running\n61\t  with images from the mirror registry.\n62\t- Pinned image digests for the operator and AuthBridge proxy images are available from the\n63\t  Konflux builds at packaging time (configuration reference gate).\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- P1: OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation.\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b27480a9e843f94f","agent_id":"a919f34342319a63d","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"d73bc661-3158-44f4-a2d6-a8934be50313","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:33:17.842Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc568dbd228c2d97","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
