{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6f8277c36878a22","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n3\ttitle: Determine AuthBridge sidecar variant set for Tech Preview\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tinvestigation_signals:\n10\t  question_specificity: 1\n11\t  source_accessibility: 0\n12\t  local_runnability: 0\n13\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: 0\n14\t  human_judgment_required: -2\n15\timplementation_type: null\n16\tdependencies: []\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Low\n19\tai_implementability_score: -1\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# Determine AuthBridge sidecar variant set for Tech Preview\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tThis investigation resolves which AuthBridge sidecar image variants must ship in Tech Preview.\n30\tUpstream kagenti-extensions provides three variants — `authbridge-proxy` (full proxy, default),\n31\t`authbridge-envoy` (Envoy ext_proc mode), and `authbridge-lite` (auth-only) — and each variant\n32\trequires its own Konflux component. The baseline plan productizes only `authbridge-proxy`\n33\t(the strategy's stated minimum viable set); this decision determines whether the additional\n34\tvariants are needed for the 3.5 release or can ship later.\n35\t\n36\t## Description of downstream impact\n37\t\n38\tIf the decision adds variants beyond the proxy, additional Konflux onboarding work (and\n39\tcorresponding CSV image entries) is required; a conditional branch epic is prepared for that\n40\toutcome. If proxy-only is confirmed, the baseline plan is complete.\n41\t\n42\t## Scope\n43\t\n44\t- Confirm with PM and the Kagenti team which AuthBridge variants are required for the 3.5 / TP\n45\t  release: proxy only, or proxy plus envoy and/or lite.\n46\t- Record the decision with rationale, including any customer commitments that require the\n47\t  additional variants.\n48\t\n49\t## Acceptance Criteria\n50\t\n51\t- Decision recorded (proxy-only vs. additional variants) with PM sign-off and rationale.\n52\t- If additional variants are required, their Konflux component list and target release are\n53\t  identified so the conditional branch work can be scheduled.\n54\t\n55\t## HLR Traceability\n56\t\n57\t- Qualifies the P1 HLR \"AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance\":\n58\t  the answer determines whether that HLR's epic scope is the complete variant set for TP or\n59\t  whether additional variant work must be added.\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b27480a9e843f94f","agent_id":"a919f34342319a63d","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"d8785d66-578a-4dc1-9726-037df594f074","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:33:23.009Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6f8277c36878a22","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
