t show (list of AgentRuntime CRs, status,\n47\t  link to workload details) and what is explicitly deferred.\n48\t\n49\t## HLR Traceability\n50\t\n51\t- Qualifies the P1 HLR \"Dashboard integration infrastructure: BFF plugin registration and\n52\t  feature flag for agent views\": the answer determines the scope and effort of that epic.\n53\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b09d530114d28c8","agent_id":"a8a4c6b9da1a738b7","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"521e718c-6217-46eb-a0ae-89c499f8cef6","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:43:01.490Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-85889be34f581d5d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
