o `kagenti/kagenti-extensions`\n48\t  before the `opendatahub-io` midstream fork.\n49\t\n50\t## Acceptance Criteria\n51\t\n52\t- The AuthBridge proxy sidecar container image passes Konflux `check-payload` validation for\n53\t  FIPS compliance.\n54\t- The Konflux build is green and produces a SHA256-pinned image digest consumable by the\n55\t  operator deployment and CSV packaging (configuration reference — no DAG dependency).\n56\t- Build supports AMD64; arm64 included only if achievable without additional effort.\n57\t\n58\t## HLR Traceability\n59\t\n60\t- P1: AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance.\n61\t- P0: Upstream-first policy (changes to `kagenti/*` before `opendatahub-io/*` midstream forks).\n62\t- P2: Multi-arch builds (AMD64 required for TP; arm64 if pipeline supports it without\n63\t  additional effort).\n64\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b09d530114d28c8","agent_id":"a8a4c6b9da1a738b7","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"2b77fe1b-92b3-4e0c-b051-3354a3e8bdc9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:43:09.529Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-91ff2b7ce2078222","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
