{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a7f1c275f7b642ff","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E004\n3\ttitle: Decide TP dashboard integration depth (project tab vs standalone navigation)\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: AI Core Dashboard\n6\tteam: Dashboard\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tinvestigation_signals:\n10\t  question_specificity: 1\n11\t  source_accessibility: 0\n12\t  local_runnability: 0\n13\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: 0\n14\t  human_judgment_required: -2\n15\timplementation_type: null\n16\tdependencies: []\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Low\n19\tai_implementability_score: -1\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# Decide TP dashboard integration depth (project tab vs standalone navigation)\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tThis investigation resolves the open question of Tech Preview dashboard integration depth: a\n30\tminimal agent list tab within an existing project view (~1 sprint of dashboard work) versus a\n31\tstandalone navigation section (~2 sprints). The answer rewrites the scope of the dashboard BFF\n32\tplugin and agent list view work, so it must be settled before that implementation starts. The\n33\tdecision is jointly owned by PM and UX, with the Dashboard team providing feasibility input.\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Obtain a UX design decision for the TP agent list surface: embedded tab in an existing project\n38\t  view or standalone navigation entry.\n39\t- Confirm the effort implications of each option against the TP timeline.\n40\t- Record the chosen option as the scope baseline for the dashboard integration work.\n41\t\n42\t## Acceptance Criteria\n43\t\n44\t- PM/UX decision recorded (tab vs standalone section) with rationale and UX wireframe or design\n45\t  direction for the chosen option.\n46\t- The decision identifies what the TP surface must show (list of AgentRuntime CRs, status,\n47\t  link to workload details) and what is explicitly deferred.\n48\t\n49\t## HLR Traceability\n50\t\n51\t- Qualifies the P1 HLR \"Dashboard integration infrastructure: BFF plugin registration and\n52\t  feature flag for agent views\": the answer determines the scope and effort of that epic.\n53\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a28eb7d292fbf1b3","agent_id":"adbb7fab2ae44893a","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"4c58981d-ca31-4770-a050-6411ba2a0d5b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:09:52.286Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a7f1c275f7b642ff","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final re-review RHAISTRAT-8006"}
