(`capabilities.drop: [\"ALL\"]`), and `seccompProfile.type: RuntimeDefault` (strategy\n48\t  NFR: container security applies to all Go operator/sidecar images).\n49\t- Ensure the proxy's TLS termination uses FIPS-approved cipher suites.\n50\t- Ensure AMD64 architecture builds; arm64 only if free.\n51\t- Follow the upstream-first policy: significant changes go to `kagenti/kagenti-extensions`\n52\t  before the `opendatahub-io` midstream fork.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- The AuthBridge proxy sidecar container image passes Konflux `check-payload` validation for\n57\t  FIPS compliance.\n58\t- The Konflux build is green and produces a SHA256-pinned image digest consumable by the\n59\t  operator deployment and CSV packaging (configuration reference — no DAG dependency).\n60\t- Build supports AMD64; arm64 included only if achievable without additional effort.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- P1: AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance.\n65\t- P0: Upstream-first policy (changes to `kagenti/*` before `opendatahub-io/*` midstream forks).\n66\t- P2: Multi-arch builds (AMD64 required for TP; arm64 if pipeline supports it without\n67\t  additional effort).\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a28eb7d292fbf1b3","agent_id":"adbb7fab2ae44893a","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"04bd638a-aa0d-4e29-a37c-d2fe9999eda8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:09:59.183Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8705ce0b9cddad6e","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final re-review RHAISTRAT-8006"}
