napproved licenses in the\n50\t  shipped dependency trees).\n51\t- Any remediations are recorded; if a dependency must change, the change follows the\n52\t  upstream-first policy.\n53\t\n54\t## HLR Traceability\n55\t\n56\t- P0: Upstream-first policy (any dependency remediation changes go upstream before midstream).\n57\t- Supports the P0 Konflux image HLRs: images cannot ship without license clearance.\n58\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a28eb7d292fbf1b3","agent_id":"adbb7fab2ae44893a","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"9cff7b43-e8d7-4082-9a79-ca09357e3327","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:09:59.977Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd125e8e149eee11","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final re-review RHAISTRAT-8006"}
