nd CSV packaging — and are covered by the conditional\n47\tPlatform-owned CSV branch work attached to the same variant-set decision, not by this epic.\n48\t\n49\t## Scope\n50\t\n51\t- Create Konflux components for each additional required AuthBridge variant, mirroring the\n52\t  AuthBridge proxy onboarding pattern (multi-stage FIPS Go build, `rpms.lock.yaml`, `go.sum`,\n53\t  UBI9 base, AMD64).\n54\t- Follow the upstream-first policy for any changes to `kagenti/kagenti-extensions`.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- Each additional variant image passes Konflux `check-payload` validation for FIPS compliance.\n59\t- Konflux builds are green with SHA256-pinned digests available to the CSV packaging work as\n60\t  configuration references (no scheduling dependency on it).\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- Extends the P1 HLR \"AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance\"\n65\t  to the additional variants required by the TP decision.\n66\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a28eb7d292fbf1b3","agent_id":"adbb7fab2ae44893a","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"cca18dbf-a2df-4a83-a606-0035201483a1","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:10:13.149Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-97f345424505f24d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final re-review RHAISTRAT-8006"}
