cumentation branch work attached to the\n47\tsame requirement decision — the main-plan documentation epic does not cover this content,\n48\tsince it has no dependency on the trace sink requirement resolution.\n49\t\n50\t## Scope\n51\t\n52\t- Implement OTEL trace sink auto-configuration for agent workloads as decided by the\n53\t  requirement resolution (endpoint wiring, exporter configuration), respecting any dependency\n54\t  on the Agent Runtime Contract work tracked in RHAIRFE-7589.\n55\t- Follow the upstream-first policy: the runtime behavior lands in `kagenti/*` upstream repos\n56\t  before the `opendatahub-io/*` midstream forks.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- Agent workloads managed by the productized operator emit traces to the platform trace sink\n61\t  without manual per-agent configuration.\n62\t- Build pipeline green for any affected images.\n63\t\n64\t## HLR Traceability\n65\t\n66\t- Covers the parent RFE (RHAIRFE-7451) OTEL trace sink MUST if confirmed for TP; currently no\n67\t  HLR in this strategy maps to it (that is the open question this branch resolves). The\n68\t  customer documentation for this capability is carried by the docs-authoring branch work in\n69\t  this branch, not by this epic.\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a28eb7d292fbf1b3","agent_id":"adbb7fab2ae44893a","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"bd36aaaf-2b6d-40bd-be72-47feceb10424","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:10:13.931Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-954c775afc6e58d3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final re-review RHAISTRAT-8006"}
