{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bcbddf81af943fa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-BRANCH-B-E017\n3\ttitle: ClusterServiceVersion entries for additional AuthBridge variants\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: AI Core Platform\n6\tteam: Platform / ODH Operator\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n11\tbranch: B\n12\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-8006-E002\n13\tgate_failure_impact:\n14\t  action: remove\n15\t  fallback_approach: If only authbridge-proxy is required for Tech Preview, this branch\n16\t    epic is dropped; no additional CSV entries are needed and the main-plan CSV packaging\n17\t    (operator and proxy entries) is the complete scope.\n18\tai_signals:\n19\t  change_specificity: 1\n20\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n21\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n22\t  existing_foundation: 1\n23\t  open_questions: 1\n24\t  external_dependency: 0\n25\t  human_process_gates: 0\n26\t  repo_access: 1\n27\t  architecture_claims: 1\n28\timplementation_type: null\n29\tinvestigation_signals: null\n30\tai_implementability: High\n31\tai_implementability_score: 6\n32\tjira_key: null\n33\t---\n34\t# ClusterServiceVersion entries for additional AuthBridge variants\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tConditional branch (outcome B of the AuthBridge variant-set investigation): if the TP variant\n39\tdecision requires AuthBridge sidecar variants beyond the default `authbridge-proxy`\n40\t(`authbridge-envoy` and/or `authbridge-lite`), add the corresponding SHA256-pinned\n41\t`RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries to the rhods-operator ClusterServiceVersion so the additional\n42\tsidecar images resolve for disconnected/air-gapped installation with image mirroring.\n43\t\n44\tThis is rhods-operator CSV packaging work owned by the Platform / ODH Operator team — the same\n45\tcomponent/team boundary the main plan draws between Konflux onboarding (Kagenti-owned) and CSV\n46\tpackaging (Platform-owned). It extends the main-plan CSV packaging for the kagenti component:\n47\tit adds entries to the ClusterServiceVersion that work produces. The image digests it pins are\n48\tconfiguration references supplied at execution time by the Konflux builds of the additional\n49\tvariants — availability is an acceptance criterion, not a scheduling dependency, so this work\n50\truns in parallel with the Konflux onboarding of those variants.\n51\t\n52\t## Scope\n53\t\n54\t- Add a SHA256-pinned `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entry to the ClusterServiceVersion for each additional\n55\t  AuthBridge variant required by the TP decision (`authbridge-envoy`, `authbridge-lite`).\n56\t- Validate the CSV renders correctly with the existing packaging tooling.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- Given a disconnected RHOAI installation using image mirroring, when the kagenti component is\n61\t  `Managed` and additional AuthBridge variants are required for TP, then each additional\n62\t  variant image resolves from the mirrored registry via its `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entry, measured\n63\t  by the variant images pulling from the mirror registry.\n64\t- Pinned image digests for the additional variant images are available from their Konflux\n65\t  builds at packaging time (configuration reference gate).\n66\t- Build pipeline green for rhods-operator changes (Konflux).\n67\t- The added entries coexist with the main-plan kagenti CSV entries in the rendered\n68\t  ClusterServiceVersion: because this work edits the same CSV artifact that the main-plan CSV\n69\t  packaging for the kagenti component produces (`RELATED_IMAGE_KAGENTI_OPERATOR` and\n70\t  `RELATED_IMAGE_AUTHBRIDGE_PROXY` plus the KagentiOperator CRD/RBAC declarations), changes are\n71\t  explicitly coordinated/rebased against that work so both sets of entries render together\n72\t  without conflict (same-file merge coordination across the branch/main-plan boundary).\n73\t\n74\t## HLR Traceability\n75\t\n76\t- Extends the P1 HLR \"OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected\n77\t  installation\" to the additional AuthBridge variants required by the TP decision (the same\n78\t  decision that extends the P1 AuthBridge Konflux HLR to the additional variants).\n79\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a28eb7d292fbf1b3","agent_id":"adbb7fab2ae44893a","session_id":"ec1d2a2a-7323-4c5d-bb4c-fc6cac99ed4f","uuid":"f8e01d17-83c4-4483-8e52-4e531f37945c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:10:14.771Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bcbddf81af943fa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Final re-review RHAISTRAT-8006"}
